WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:09.993
In tutorial 7.5, you'll
run a technical audit,

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:12.567
to find every issue
that costs you visitors.

00:00:13.607 --> 00:00:19.177
First, open Run an analysis. Under Audit
& track, click Start on Site audit.

00:00:19.227 --> 00:00:22.740
You can also start it from
Technical health, with Run an audit.

00:00:23.724 --> 00:00:28.549
Choose Technical audit to check your
site's health, or the Full SEO report,

00:00:28.599 --> 00:00:32.123
which adds keywords, competitors,
links and AI answers.

00:00:33.167 --> 00:00:37.612
Next, pick how many pages to
read. 200 suits most sites.

00:00:37.662 --> 00:00:40.511
Choose 500 or 1,000 for bigger ones.

00:00:41.617 --> 00:00:45.017
If your site only shows its
content after the page loads,

00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:48.992
which your developer can tell
you, turn on Render JavaScript,

00:00:49.042 --> 00:00:51.629
so pages are read the
way visitors see them.

00:00:52.644 --> 00:00:55.369
For the full report,
check your competitors.

00:00:55.419 --> 00:00:58.990
They're filled in from your website
settings, and you can change them here.

00:01:01.123 --> 00:01:04.748
The summary shows the credits
it uses and the time it takes.

00:01:04.798 --> 00:01:09.894
Click Start the full report. It runs on
its own, and you can follow it under Runs.

00:01:10.853 --> 00:01:15.578
When it's done, your full report shows
the health score, a PDF and Word copy,

00:01:15.628 --> 00:01:19.153
the issues to fix first, a
fix pack for your developers,

00:01:19.203 --> 00:01:21.082
and how your site does in search.

00:01:22.111 --> 00:01:26.166
So, open Site audit, choose
the report, pick the pages,

00:01:26.216 --> 00:01:30.066
turn on JavaScript if you need it,
check competitors, and start it.

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:35.720
Your audit is on its way. Next, read
the audit and download the fix pack,

00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:37.818
in tutorial 7.6.
